{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game adds a twist to the Rogue-like Deck builder genre by separating the combat in two phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first phase you will load your revolver with the cards you want to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, the shooting begins, where you will &quot;shoot&quot; your cards one by one, while the enemy &quot;shoots&quot; back in-between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/3dd0315760b12a18bd4fae933740c383.poster.avif?t=1768291705\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/3dd0315760b12a18bd4fae933740c383.webm?t=1768291705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/3dd0315760b12a18bd4fae933740c383.mp4?t=1768291705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game takes place in a new unique map where cards battles won't be the only way to progress and upgrade your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find duels, where the faster shooter wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saloons were you will find good deals on cards to add to your deck and have a drink to help you recover some health (don't drink too much or you will get dizzy).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/6b77d372ef16f09f26d0489601748ea7.poster.avif?t=1768291705\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/6b77d372ef16f09f26d0489601748ea7.webm?t=1768291705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/6b77d372ef16f09f26d0489601748ea7.mp4?t=1768291705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to beat the boss at the end of the level to go further into more complicated and fun encounters as your deck of cards evolves.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2081790?t=1768291705","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2081790?t=1768291705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/5bc39c39fcf415ff44075c1bdcfd62c5617b726c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768291705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/5bc39c39fcf415ff44075c1bdcfd62c5617b726c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768291705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play on Phone","id":41},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2081820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game adds a twist to the Rogue-like Deck builder genre by separating the combat in two phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first phase you will load your revolver with the cards you want to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, the shooting begins, where you will &quot;shoot&quot; your cards one by one, while the enemy &quot;s